ose 2.9.4 because it is the smallest fixed release on the current 2.x line.\n- **Branch:** `fix/cve-2026-31337-fastjson-2.9.4`, with two changes: the pin in `requirements.txt` and a line under \"Unreleased\" in `CHANGELOG.md`.\n- **CI:** run `ci-0001` on commit `6c69ace862` passed.\n- **PR:** #101, https://git.example/payments-service/pull/101.\n\nThe PR is open, not merged. Merging into main needs approval from a code owner under org policy.", "type": "text"}]}]}